<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT -- Borders named &quot;Focus One&quot; stock.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT -- Borders named &quot;Focus One&quot; stock.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it named Borders Group Inc a &quot;Focus One&quot; stock.</p>
<p>-- said Borders remains a near, long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- Borders closed Tuesday at 18-3/4.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
